sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Counter (Edge PWA)
  participant ORD as Order svc
  participant BIL as Billing svc
  participant DEV as Device Gateway
  participant RES as Result svc
  participant REP as Reporting svc
  participant NOTI as Notification
  C->>ORD: Register patient + create order (offline-first)
  C->>BIL: Generate invoice (cash/UPI/partial, GST)
  C->>ORD: Accession + print barcode
  ORD-->>RES: OrderCreated (event)
  DEV->>RES: Analyzer result (HL7) for accession
  RES->>RES: Auto-validate (range/delta/critical)
  RES-->>REP: ResultValidated (event)
  REP->>REP: Render PDF + pathologist sign-off + digital signature
  REP-->>NOTI: ReportReady (event)
  NOTI->>C: WhatsApp/SMS/email (secure link)
